    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Office of Student Experience conducted its first townhall of 2023 for students of AKU's Medical College, School of Nursing and Midwifery, and Institute of Educational Development with over 300 students were in attendance. Dr. Laila Akbarali, Interim Vice Provost - Student Affairs and Services and University Registrar, conducted the townhall and introduced the  Provost Experiential Learning Fund Programme . Danish Imtiaz, Associate Director, Student Experience, gave an overview of the program along with the eligibility criteria.",
